  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_5103.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(87 fotos) Dimecres ha hagut bous de la ramaderia del Mas de Pere i a la segonda embolada un jove ha resultat amb una ferida a la cuixa per la palometa del ferro de la bola. Ha sigut traslladat a l&#39;hospital per a observaci&oacute; per&ograve; ja est&agrave; a casa.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ProcessoSantBartomeuTossalet.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Dijous s&#39;ha festejat Sant Bartomeu, amb process&oacute;, missa i repartiment de rotllos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3918.jpg\" alt=\"img_3918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3921.jpg\" alt=\"img_3921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3924.jpg\" alt=\"img_3924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3925.jpg\" alt=\"img_3925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3926.jpg\" alt=\"img_3926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3927.jpg\" alt=\"img_3927\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresdijousfestestosalet/img_3928.jpg\" alt=\"img_3928\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimec